# SAVE as a Berlinan document (AppServices.saveDocument): the project and the snapshot slots to flash, and both
# back after a restart as they were.
# - Nothing saved: the Demo trio in A minor (as the Mac's launch), its seed drawn at the first Play.
# - The template (on a seed of its own), the key, the tempo, a channel and the arranger (the slow build, AUTO off: the
#   form kept) changed stopped, the density while playing (the project's at once, the engine's at the next bar), slot
#   2 stored at the render head after ten bars (the patterns mutated).
# - SAVE while playing waits for the stop (its LED blinking): then the project and slot 2, two writes, once what the
#   stop sends (MIDI Stop, the offs) has gone out: a flash write stops everything for a moment.
# - A reboot: the same project, slot 2 lit and holding the same patterns; recalled, the engine plays them from the
#   next bar. A SAVE while playing with no slot stored since: one write, at a stop not the button's.
# pat_hash: FNV-1a 64 over the running engine's patterns (their notes, not their lifecycles); slot_pat2: the same over
# slot 2's.
expect tpl 0
expect seeded 0
expect seed_lo 0xBE1271A9
tap PLAY
expect seeded 1
expect seed_lo 0xe2e2674d
tap PLAY
proj template demo 0x5EED1234
proj key 2 dorian
proj tempo 120
proj channel bass 5
proj form slow
proj arranger off
expect tpl 0
expect root 2
expect mode 1
expect bpm 120
expect chan2 5
expect seed_hi 0
expect seed_lo 0x5EED1234
expect form 2
expect arr_on 0
tap PLAY
wait 2000
proj density 40
expect density_pct 40
wait 18000
slot store 2
expect slot_used2 1
expect pat_hash_hi 0x442d3fdd
expect slot_pat2_hi 0x442d3fdd
expect pat_hash_lo 0x65e6daaf
expect slot_pat2_lo 0x65e6daaf
expect store_writes 0
tap SAVE
expect save_pending 1
expect store_writes 0
wait 100
expect save_lit 1
wait 256
expect save_lit 0
wait 1000
expect store_writes 0
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
expect save_pending 0
expect save_lit 0
expect store_writes 2
expect save_unsent 0
reboot
expect playing 0
expect tpl 0
expect root 2
expect mode 1
expect bpm 120
expect chan2 5
expect density_pct 40
expect seed_lo 0x5EED1234
expect seeded 1
expect form 2
expect arr_on 0
expect slot_used2 1
expect slot_used1 0
wait 50
expect slot_lit2 1
expect slot_lit1 0
expect slot_pat2_hi 0x442d3fdd
expect slot_pat2_lo 0x65e6daaf
# after the reboot: the project's own patterns (generation 0's), then slot 2's from bar 2 (tick 7680), before any of
# them loops; the recall pushed an undo point
tap PLAY
wait 3000
expect pat_hash_hi 0xabd25f74
slot recall 2
expect undo_depth 1
wait 1500
expect head >7680
expect head <11280
expect pat_hash_hi 0x442d3fdd
expect pat_hash_lo 0x65e6daaf
# a stop of the transport's own (as MIDI Stop or the arranger's ending: not the button) writes it too
tap SAVE
wait 500
expect store_writes 2
rt stop
wait 20
expect playing 0
expect save_pending 0
expect store_writes 3
expect save_unsent 0
